[{"answer":"Good morning. Can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. I've just been accepted on a course at the university","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd like to try and arrange accommodation in the hall of residence.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, certainly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Please sit down.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/5.mp3"},{"answer":"What I'll do is fill in a form with you to find out a little more about your preferences and so forth.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/7.mp3"},{"answer":"So, first of all, can I take your name?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/8.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Anu Bhatt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you spell your name please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/11.mp3"},{"answer":"ANU... BHATT.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, and could I ask your date of birth?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The 31st of March, 1972.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/15.mp3"},{"answer":"And where are you from?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/16.mp3"},{"answer":"India.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/18.mp3"},{"answer":"And um... what will you be studying?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm doing a course in nursing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/21.mp3"},{"answer":"And how long would you want to stay in hall, do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it'll take three years","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/23.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'd only like to stay in hall for two.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd like to think about living outside for the third year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/26.mp3"},{"answer":"And what did you have in mind for catering?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you want to cook for yourself or have all your meals provided, that's full board?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Is there something in between?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. You can just have evening meal provided, which is half board.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/30.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what I'd prefer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, a lot of students opt for that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, with that in mind, do you have any special diet, anything we should know about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I don't take red meat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/34.mp3"},{"answer":"No red meat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, thinking about the room itself, we have a number of options.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/36.mp3"},{"answer":"You can have a single study bedroom or you can have a shared one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/37.mp3"},{"answer":"These are both what we call simple rooms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/38.mp3"},{"answer":"The other alternative is to opt for a single bedsit","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/39.mp3"},{"answer":"which actually has more space and better facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/40.mp3"},{"answer":"There's about £20 a week difference between them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, actually my grant is quite generous and I think the bedsit sounds the best option.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Lovely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/43.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll put you down for that and we'll see what availability is like.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Now can I ask some other personal details which we like to have on record?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/46.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder if you could let us know what your interests are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/47.mp3"},{"answer":"This might help us get a closer match for placing you in a particular hall.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Well. I love the theatre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/50.mp3"},{"answer":"And I enjoy sports, particularly badminton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah, that's worth knowing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, what we finish with on the form is really a list from you of what your priorities are in choosing a hall","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/53.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'll do our best to take these into account.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the first thing is I'd prefer a hall where there are other mature students, if possible.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we do have halls which tend to cater for slightly older students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Ummm and I'd prefer to be out of town.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/57.mp3"},{"answer":"That's actually very good for you because we tend to have more vacancies in out-of-town halls.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Lucky!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I would like somewhere with a shared area, a TV room for example, or something like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/62.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a good way to socialise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Certainly is.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/64.mp3"},{"answer":"That's it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, we just need a contact telephone number for you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, I'll just find it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/67.mp3"},{"answer":"It's 667549.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Great, so we'll be in contact with you as soon as possible...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-9-test-2-part-1-2023-07-23-08-16-08/69.mp3"}]
